    "title": "When does men's Final Four start? Teams, schedule, how to watch and more",
    "text": "April 2, 2026, 4:04 p.m. ETIn just a few days, the 2026 men's college basketball season will come to a close.The Final Four of the 2026 NCAA Tournament will begin this weekend at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis.Here's everything to know, including how to watch.Who are the men's Final Four teams in March Madness?No. 1 seed Michigan (Midwest)No. 1 seed Arizona (West)No. 2 seed UConn (East)No. 3 seed Illinois (South)When is the men's Final Four?The Final Four games take place on Saturday, April 4.What time are the men's Final Four games?UConn takes on Illinois at 6:09 p.m. ET, and Michigan battles Arizona at 8:49 p.m. ET.Where are the men's Final Four games?The Final Four and the championship games take place at the Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, the home venue of the NFL’s Indianapolis Colts. How to watch men's March Madness Final Four gamesThis year's Final Four games and the 2026 NCAA championship game will air live on TBS and will be streamed on the March Madness Live app (which requires a TV provider login) or Sling TV.Watch March Madness Final Four games on SlingMen's Final Four scheduleNo. 3 Illinois vs. No. 2 UConn | 6:09 p.m. ETNo. 1 Michigan vs. No. 1 Arizona | 8:49 p.m. ETWhen is the men's March Madness championship game?The men's NCAA Division I men's basketball championship is Monday, April 6.Who won men's March Madness 2026?The winner of the 2026 NCAA Tournament has yet to be determined.Who won men's March Madness 2025?No. 1 seed Florida won the 2025 NCAA men's tournament, beating No. 1 Houston 65-63. Florida's latest victory was the program's third national title, per the NCAA website. Florida previously won back-to-back championships in 2006 and 2007.USA TODAY's Craig Meyer and Austin Curtright contributed to this report.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
